use firn/tags

gitleaks is a Module
gitleaks is tagged cli-tools

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.gitleaks.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.gitleaks]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."gitleaks"."enable": enable "Enable gitleaks secret scanner (safe-push depends on it being on PATH)"
